Code adapted from Apache-2.0 licensed projects:

5. Glyphifier - https://github.com/AhmedYasser5/Glyphifier
   Apache License 2.0, Copyright 2026 Ahmed Ezzat. Full licence text: licenses/Glyphifier-LICENSE.txt
   (also https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Glyphifier has no NOTICE file.
   Its logic was adapted, with changes, into:
   - app/.../engine/AlertQueue.kt: calls queued ahead of other alerts, bounded queue dropping the oldest
     non-call, re-posts updated in place, never preempting what is playing, and the per-conversation
     re-post cooldown (from PlaybackQueue.kt and the cooldown in its GlyphNotificationListener.kt).
     Changed: hold-until-read / until-unlock alerts, cycle-boundary switching, no staleness expiry.
   - app/.../rules/Rules.kt (RuleEngine.decide, RuleEngine.regex): match by specificity tier rather than list
     order, and the compiled-regex cache (from rules/RuleMatcher.kt). Changed: person and caller tiers, allow
     and blocking rules decided before showing ones, manual priority tiebreak, match explanations.
   - app/.../notify/GlyphNotificationListener.kt: ringing calls posted as group summaries are kept (from its
     GlyphNotificationListener.kt).

